      "width": 555.46875,
      "height": 62.400000000000006,
      "text": "var dto = await ctx.Products.AsNoTracking()\n   .Where(p => p.Id == id)\n   .Select(p => new ProductDto { Id = p.Id, Name = p.Name, Price = p.Price, ...\n}).FirstOrDefaultAsync(ct);",
