    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "r_sql_t",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 417.25,
      "width": 689.6484375,
      "height": 71.5,
      "text": "Provider-specific SQL generation:\n  Postgres (Npgsql):    SELECT p.\"Id\", p.\"Name\", p.\"Price\", ... FROM \"Products\" p WHERE p.\"Id\" = @__id_0\nLIMIT 1\n  SQL Server (SqlClient): SELECT TOP(1) [p].[Id], [p].[Name], [p].[Price], ... FROM [Products] AS [p] WHERE\n[p].[Id] = @__id_0",
      "originalText": "Provider-specific SQL generation:\n  Postgres (Npgsql):    SELECT p.\"Id\", p.\"Name\", p.\"Price\", ... FROM \"Products\" p WHERE p.\"Id\" = @__id_0 LIMIT 1\n  SQL Server (SqlClient): SELECT TOP(1) [p].[Id], [p].[Name], [p].[Price], ... FROM [Products] AS [p] WHERE [p].[Id] = @__id_0",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
